				<guid>http://localhost:1313/docs/hobby/place/daily12/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;카페-오딘&#34;&gt;&#xA;  카페 오딘&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#%ec%b9%b4%ed%8e%98-%ec%98%a4%eb%94%98&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;#2025-03-29&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38c46c83-b5b8-4ce6-8f02-2d58b7c77ef1&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;바다뷰가 넘 예뻤던 카페&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7adb3a81-b533-427a-83ef-8f1a386ffc80&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;저 크림들어간 크로와상이 완전 짱맛..! 샐러드두 맛있었당&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20c7941c-b370-43e8-8190-f50f35f02004&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/45973a5b-a669-49ce-89f9-fbc8b5ee55d3&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cb2b7aa8-7644-46ab-960d-9d6c82712ed6&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;바깥뷰도 이뻐서 나가서 걸어주기에좋다&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;이날 기분이별로였어서 아쉽다 담에가면 더마싯게먹고 잘구경하고다닐텐데!!!! 아쉬움이남아서 다시가고싶다 ㅎ&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
